		<data>
			<say>
				<who>FR_ASSASIN</who>
				<text>Marcus: Puntis, old friend, you are still alive! I had no hope of meeting you ever again.</text>
			</say>
			<say>
				<who>FR_SABOTEUR</who>
				<text>Puntis: No time to talk. I've seen Undead Rangers among the undead. You must rely on my skills, or we will be smashed.</text>
			</say>
			<say>
				<who>FR_SABOTEUR</who>
				<text>Puntis: I need some time to hide in shadows. Next, help me to get as close as possible to the archers and casters: I'll disable them for a few minutes.</text>
			</say>
